(In reply to comment #5)
> wine: configuration in '/root/.wine' has been updated.

"NEVER run Wine as root!"
http://wiki.winehq.org/FAQ#head-96bebfa287b4288974de0df23351f278b0d41014

Nonetheless I assume you do not have debug symbols installed for
libdrm_nouveau.so.2 (libdrm), nouveau_dri.so (Mesa) [and optional for this bug
wined3d_buffer_map (Wine)].

The autogenerated backtrace (attachment in #c0) should be more informative if
you install them.

